Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.13,0:00:06.92,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I had a pretty simple reason for\Njoining my spy academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.79,0:00:10.13,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,My parents' restaurant got destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.50,0:00:12.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I needed to start earning my own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.79,0:00:17.00,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Other people had much nobler motivations than me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:19.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,so it's no wonder I washed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.50,0:00:25.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You need to recognize your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.71,0:00:42.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What if we quit pullin' our punches\Nand just blow Klaus's whole room up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.75,0:00:43.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.96,0:00:45.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When should we set the bomb?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.17,0:00:47.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, we'd gotta start by luring him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:51.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We could tell him we made him dinner,\Nso he should come to the dining room.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:52.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.67,0:00:56.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then, we can use that opening to\Nplant a bomb under his bed!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.67,0:01:01.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I find it hard to imagine that\Nbeing enough to take down the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.92,0:01:04.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maybe, but it'll give us some valuable intel either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.71,0:01:07.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nah, I think this'll work!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.13,0:01:09.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We just need a big enough kaboom!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.29,0:01:10.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A real kablooey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.46,0:01:11.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm in!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.71,0:01:14.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wanna make it go kablooey too, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.04,0:01:15.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Point of interest, if I may?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.42,0:01:20.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's something nobody is mentioning,\Nso I suppose I'd better say it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.33,0:01:23.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We may need to start worrying about\Nthe manor's structural integrity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.54,0:02:58.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ever since we got here,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.25,0:03:00.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,we've been attacking Teach daily
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.54,0:03:02.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,to try to make him surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.67,0:03:05.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Destruction and explosions have become\Nan everyday occurrence for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.33,0:03:08.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and it's getting to the point where the damage to\Nthe manor's is getting too severe to overlook.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.96,0:03:11.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,To illustrate how bad it's gotten,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.33,0:03:13.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,one of us got literally crushed last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.21,0:03:14.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.42,0:03:17.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Apparently, one of the doors fell over\Nthe same way it did just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.67,0:03:18.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It really hurt...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.92,0:03:21.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's starting to interfere with our day-to-day activities.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.13,0:03:25.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I say we should start taking turns repairing the manor\Nthe same way we handle the cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.13,0:03:26.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mark me as opposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.83,0:03:31.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're about to head out on a\Ndeath-defying mission, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.13,0:03:32.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We don't have time to play handyman.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.33,0:03:34.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's no reason to throw\Neverything else to the wayside.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.17,0:03:38.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right now, we need to devote every\Nspare second we have to our training.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.58,0:03:40.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We can worry about fixing the place up later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.25,0:03:43.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I bet you just don't want to do any more chores.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.29,0:03:45.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, believe what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.79,0:03:48.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Besides, the place gets fixed up\Non its own sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.25,0:03:52.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Klaus probably calls in specialist contractors.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.46,0:03:54.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You know, repairmen who specialize in\Nworking with spies or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.04,0:04:00.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Big Sis Monika was talking nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.50,0:04:04.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The manor definitely gets repaired sometimes,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.42,0:04:07.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I've never seen a single contractor around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.42,0:04:10.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's the work of a ghost.\NI'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.46,0:04:12.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Big Sis Sara?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.63,0:04:15.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's a pretty out-there idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.21,0:04:17.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure ghosts don't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.71,0:04:19.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.08,0:04:22.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Last night, when I was walking down the hallway...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.13,0:04:36.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How unlucky...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.63,0:04:39.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then, I met a terrible fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.50,0:04:43.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And that's why you're sticking to me\Nlike glue, Miss Erna?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.75,0:04:45.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Because you're afraid of the ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.63,0:04:49.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you're scared, you're welcome to come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.25,0:04:51.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your animals are scary too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.50,0:04:53.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's a ghost in the manor,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.29,0:04:56.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and there are your animals in the shed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.75,0:04:59.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm stuck between a rock and a hard place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.46,0:05:01.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.79,0:05:04.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My pets wouldn't hurt a fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.79,0:05:06.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He won't bite me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.08,0:05:08.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've trained him not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.42,0:05:11.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can borrow him to use as a guard dog\Nto protect you from the ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.46,0:05:14.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's super toasty when he sleeps with you at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.92,0:05:20.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A-and you're sure he doesn't bite?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.13,0:05:23.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Positive, I made sure to teach him that it's not okay to-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.75,0:05:27.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, no, he's just play-biting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.17,0:05:30.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a way of showing affection, so it shouldn't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.50,0:05:32.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...Does it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.04,0:05:34.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,YEEEEEEEP!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.08,0:05:36.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm so, so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.71,0:05:44.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I feel so guilty about what happened back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.38,0:05:47.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Plus, I'm pretty sure that ghost she saw was-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.25,0:05:53.25,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Who could be up this late?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.25,0:05:56.92,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,All the others are asleep\Nbecause of how tired they are from training.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.04,0:05:59.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,B-but in that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.00,0:06:02.21,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,is it a burglar?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.83,0:06:10.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that you, Sara?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.33,0:06:12.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,T-Teach?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.17,0:06:19.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.21,0:06:21.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's as you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.58,0:06:24.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You mean you're washing dishes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.08,0:06:27.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What, is it really that odd to see me doing housework?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.58,0:06:29.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A-a little bit, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.83,0:06:31.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is part of my training.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.67,0:06:35.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There are times when I need to\Nmasquerade as a butler or a chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.63,0:06:40.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Also, I was the lowest in\Nthe pecking order on my old team.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.63,0:06:42.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Doing the chores got to be a habit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.83,0:06:44.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,People have many sides to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.83,0:06:48.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And you're no different.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.17,0:06:50.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That toolbox you're carrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.75,0:06:53.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're the one who's been repairing the manor\Nnight after night, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.83,0:06:58.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.50,0:06:59.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You didn't like the situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.92,0:07:01.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so you decided to work alone\Nto support your teammates.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.88,0:07:03.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I commend your altruism.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.50,0:07:06.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not many people would have done that,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.21,0:07:10.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,much less chosen to\Nremain anonymous while doing so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.50,0:07:14.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However, I'm less pleased with the fact that\Nyou're the only one losing sleep over this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.58,0:07:16.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If the manor's state is getting in the way of your training,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.46,0:07:18.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,then you really ought to be repairing it as a group.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.46,0:07:21.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll let the others know tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.17,0:07:23.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry you've had to handle all the repairs yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.04,0:07:24.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, not it at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.29,0:07:31.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You, um, you don't have to tell the others\Nabout what I've been doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.63,0:07:33.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.08,0:07:38.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I recognize that I'm the weakest member on the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.29,0:07:45.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I spent the least amount of time attending\Na spy academy out of everyone here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.33,0:07:48.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Though even if we'd gone for\Nthe same amount of time,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.29,0:07:50.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I probably would still have fallen behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.71,0:07:54.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The point is, I know I'm not a very good spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.21,0:07:59.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The least I can do is help out so the others\Ncan get a good night's sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.17,0:08:02.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is me recognizing my place,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.71,0:08:05.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,just like my academy taught me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.96,0:08:08.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What the hell kind of education\Nare they giving over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.54,0:08:12.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You should head to bed for the night, Sara.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.54,0:08:14.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I read you loud and clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.54,0:08:16.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y-yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.67,0:08:19.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please, Miss Lily, you have to get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.17,0:08:22.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're in charge of making breakfast, remember?\N{\rSubtitle-3}C'mon, leave me alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.00,0:08:25.83,Subtitle-4,,0,0,0,,I didn't steal the cookies, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.33,0:08:27.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is she dreaming about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.13,0:08:29.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is she dreaming about?\N{\rSubtitle-3}Sure, I went over to the cupboard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.79,0:08:34.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But all I did was move them a teensy bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.63,0:08:35.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Where to?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.63,0:08:36.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My tummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.63,0:08:38.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's clearly stealing them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.50,0:08:43.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just had a horrible nightmare\Nwhere I was falsely accused of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.25,0:08:44.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's just obviously a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.46,0:08:48.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now, we need to hurry or the others will wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.75,0:08:51.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's that nice smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.00,0:08:59.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Sara and Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.08,0:09:01.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Teach? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.17,0:09:06.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I thought it might be nice for me\Nto treat you to a meal every now and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.96,0:09:11.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Could you go wake the others up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.38,0:09:16.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hot damn, that was tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.29,0:09:17.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was exquisite.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.79,0:09:21.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're our boss, Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.58,0:09:23.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll follow you to the ends of the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.38,0:09:25.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I was ever gonna find someone\Nbetter at cooking than me,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.67,0:09:27.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,it makes sense it'd be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.33,0:09:31.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd be happy to date you,\Nif it meant getting to eat like this every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.88,0:09:34.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As your superior, rewarding you for\Nyour efforts is part of the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.63,0:09:38.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This dressing...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.13,0:09:40.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,is especially delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.58,0:09:43.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's really something else!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.58,0:09:45.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's plenty tasty on its own,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.96,0:09:50.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but when boiled down with pepper and red wine,\Nit becomes a wonderful steak sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.58,0:09:56.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And I just so happened to pick up some\Nfresh beef tenderloin at the market this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.96,0:10:02.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm letting it breathe for a bit,\Nbut by tonight, it will be perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.58,0:10:03.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He doesn't miss, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.63,0:10:04.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's the perfect boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.79,0:10:06.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's the self-proclaimed World's Strongest!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.96,0:10:10.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Teach! Teach! Teach! Teach!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.88,0:10:14.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I had no idea you all would be so pleased.\N{\rSubtitle-3}Teach! Teach! Teach! Teach!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.63,0:10:16.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm happy you feel that way.\N{\rSubtitle-3}Teach! Teach! Teach! Teach!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.08,0:10:18.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But I have to ask,\N{\rSubtitle-3}Teach! Teach! Teach! Teach!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.42,0:10:22.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,who said that any of you were getting this meat?\N{\rSubtitle-3}Teach! Teach! Teach! Teach-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.96,0:10:28.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um, what happened to rewarding your subordinates?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.67,0:10:30.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I made you breakfast, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.46,0:10:32.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What about the tenderloin you just bought?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.08,0:10:33.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's for my dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.38,0:10:35.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You got anything you want to say to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.29,0:10:37.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and get back to your training.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.58,0:10:40.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Meat! Meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.38,0:10:45.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Meat! Meat! Meat! Meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.50,0:10:47.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you want this steak,\N{\rSubtitle-3}Meat! Meat! Meat! Meat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.83,0:10:49.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,what do you say we have a little contest?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.63,0:10:50.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.92,0:10:52.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.38,0:10:54.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.38,0:10:56.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The odds will be overwhelmingly in your favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.42,0:11:05.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The rules of the contest are simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.08,0:11:09.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'll be competing to see who can mend the door,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.04,0:11:14.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,clean the bath, sweep the hall, replace a window,\Nand wipe the other windows the fastest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.38,0:11:16.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Those will be our five rounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.63,0:11:20.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and if you beat in me in any of them,\Nthe steak is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.38,0:11:24.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However, using violence to obstruct\Nthe other team is against the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.33,0:11:25.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.17,0:11:26.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.38,0:11:27.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Meat! Meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.88,0:11:32.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The first round will be mending the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.00,0:11:36.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whichever side returns their door to\Nits original state first is the winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.13,0:11:39.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What exactly is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.58,0:11:42.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a starting bell I made!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.50,0:11:46.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can you rig it so that Teach ends up\Nstarting after we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.21,0:11:48.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That doesn't make any sense, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.67,0:11:51.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The key will be figuring out how to\Nleverage our numbers to our advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.04,0:11:53.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If we can figure out a way to use all\Nseven of us at the same time...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.92,0:11:57.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Worry not, with me at the helm, this will be a breeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.54,0:12:01.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's time for me show just what I'm made of.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.42,0:12:02.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is everyone ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.88,0:12:12.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sybilla, go measure the damaged section!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.67,0:12:15.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Monika and Lily,\Nyou're in charge of cutting the wood!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.33,0:12:18.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sara, prep the varnish and paint\Nwe're going to use for the-
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.54,0:12:19.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All done.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.88,0:12:22.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,B-but how?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.58,0:12:26.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Once I jammed my knife in,\Ncut the wood with suitable movements,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.79,0:12:29.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and accurately eyeballed the measurements,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.63,0:12:33.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,all I had to do was be as fast as\Na winter wind descending a mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.46,0:12:35.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you mean,\N"accurately eyeballed the measurements"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.58,0:12:39.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, we lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.17,0:12:41.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It would seem that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.17,0:12:44.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, we're cleanin' the bath for round two?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.67,0:12:47.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We brought too many people\Non the mission last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.25,0:12:49.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're gonna change up the plan a bit for this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.33,0:12:50.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.58,0:12:53.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We'll dedicate one person to getting in Klaus's way,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.42,0:12:56.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and I'll pull out at all the stops\Nto make up the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.96,0:12:59.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, this is a change.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.21,0:13:01.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd hear you\Nget so serious about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.29,0:13:03.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You want the meat that bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.13,0:13:04.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.42,0:13:06.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm just sick of losing all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.38,0:13:09.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But isn't running interference against the rules?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.67,0:13:11.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Physical attacks are a no-go, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.38,0:13:12.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lily, duty calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.96,0:13:14.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Aye aye, cap'n!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.50,0:13:16.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you need someone harassed, I'm your gal!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.33,0:13:18.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's enjoying herself a bit too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.17,0:13:22.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Heya, Teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.38,0:13:24.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've been meaning to ask,\Nbut do you have any friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.04,0:13:26.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You totally don't, do you?\NYou want me to hang out with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.58,0:13:28.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All you gotta do is pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.54,0:13:30.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's that, cat got your tongue?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.50,0:13:34.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you pretending to be focusing on your cleaning\Nso you can cry on the inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.67,0:13:36.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way, Lily...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.04,0:13:37.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you planning on doing after you beat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.42,0:13:39.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sure, you'll get your hands on some steak.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.75,0:13:41.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But it will be split into sevenths,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.88,0:13:44.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and only one of them will be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.88,0:13:49.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you join my side, though,\Nyou could get the whole steak to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.71,0:13:53.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did that thought ever cross your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.00,0:13:56.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're a clever girl.\NI'm sure you'll make the right call.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.33,0:13:58.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.63,0:14:00.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The showerhead started spraying you all on its own!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.67,0:14:12.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You rat! How many times must you sabotage me\Nbefore you've had your fill?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.50,0:14:15.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I'll never give in to your torture!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.00,0:14:16.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm all done cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.83,0:14:19.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And Lily, I was lying earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.00,0:14:20.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.50,0:14:22.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You don't get to use that word!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.54,0:14:27.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It looks like we can't rely on the others for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.92,0:14:31.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I had no idea they were so useless.\NI'm disappointed in them, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.67,0:14:33.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, the two of them sound fired up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.21,0:14:35.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you have some sort of plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.75,0:14:38.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I smell misfortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.17,0:14:52.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, all her dust blew over to a spot\NTeach just finished sweeping!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.79,0:14:54.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's going to cost him a lot of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.88,0:14:56.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've got your back, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.75,0:14:58.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Time to break out my\Nspecial deluxe cleaning machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.38,0:15:03.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeeeeeeep!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.08,0:15:09.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm all done sweeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.29,0:15:12.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure we would've won\Nif you hadn't gotten in my way, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.46,0:15:15.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was clearly all your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.46,0:15:17.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll handle this one solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.33,0:15:20.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That will give me more room to move,\Nso I'll be able to use my full strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.63,0:15:22.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You all can just shut up and watch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.92,0:15:24.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All done.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.96,0:15:25.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.79,0:15:27.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good going, Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.00,0:15:29.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, whose side are you on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.38,0:15:32.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here it is, the final round.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.42,0:15:34.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The last round is a window washing showdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.58,0:15:37.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whoever cleans their set of second-floor\Nwindows first wins the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.33,0:15:41.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Our numbers advantage should\Ngive us a massive edge...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.08,0:15:43.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...but I still don't see us winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.00,0:15:46.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Water's gonna be the bottleneck here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.25,0:15:47.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Water?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.50,0:15:51.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The quickest way to wash is by making\Na huge splash all over the window,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.21,0:15:53.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,then wiping it clean in one big go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.50,0:15:56.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The problem is, it'll take too long\Nto come down for more water
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.04,0:15:59.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and get back up to the second floor\Nbetween each window.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.75,0:16:02.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's more of a hassle, but our only real choice\Nis to spray them a little at a time
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.25,0:16:04.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so we can get them wet while\Nstill conserving our water.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.38,0:16:10.67,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,Wait, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.13,0:16:13.00,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,If we just need to transport water...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.13,0:16:17.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sara?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.17,0:16:20.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Forget her!\NEvery second counts here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.79,0:16:25.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Found them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.33,0:16:27.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm code name Meadow,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.04,0:16:28.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and it's time to run circles around them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.21,0:16:33.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Damn, Teach is already two-thirds of the way done!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.25,0:16:35.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But we only just got to the halfway point!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.50,0:16:39.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll never throw in the towel!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.50,0:16:41.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Meat! Meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.50,0:16:42.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.63,0:16:45.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've got something for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.13,0:16:46.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bernard!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.83,0:16:48.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mr. Aiden!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.33,0:16:55.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This might do the trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.54,0:16:56.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We've got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.92,0:17:00.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mr. Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.38,0:17:17.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're making good time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.79,0:17:19.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're right on his heels, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.17,0:17:20.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeep!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.04,0:17:28.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm just getting started!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.75,0:17:38.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Meat...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.50,0:17:40.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In the end, he swept us 5-0.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.04,0:17:42.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Eh, could've been worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.46,0:17:44.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,At least he cooked us that one pity steak.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.88,0:17:47.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But we had to split it seven ways!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.00,0:17:49.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I finished mine in a single bite!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.38,0:17:51.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Anyways, I'm gonna turn in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.00,0:17:53.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.21,0:17:54.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A-actually, if I may.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.33,0:17:57.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Would it be all right if I made a suggestion?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.21,0:18:01.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you say to starting up\Na repairs rotation after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.75,0:18:03.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think it would be for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.13,0:18:05.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Like I said yesterday, I object.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.92,0:18:08.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You really think we've got time for that
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.21,0:18:10.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,when we've got a life-or-death mission\Njust two weeks away?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.21,0:18:12.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But doing repairs is a form of training too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.92,0:18:15.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Being a spy isn't only about taking down targets.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.46,0:18:18.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Having to deal with the cooking and cleaning\Nis enough of a hassle already.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.75,0:18:22.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But Miss Monika, don't you play hooky\Nfrom those all the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.17,0:18:24.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh dear, that's not a very good look.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.96,0:18:27.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Dang, she's really got you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.88,0:18:31.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I respect your strength a lot, Miss Monika.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.46,0:18:33.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But chores are chores.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.21,0:18:36.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We need to be fair about how we split them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.17,0:18:39.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...Is kind of sort of how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.38,0:18:44.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,B-but I'm probably speaking out of turn, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.83,0:18:47.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I fully agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.75,0:18:57.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fine, I'll do better.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.75,0:19:04.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good, so you were able to broach\Nthe topic with the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.13,0:19:05.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.13,0:19:06.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And it's all thanks to you, Teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.79,0:19:08.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.83,0:19:10.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.67,0:19:14.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this, though?\NThis is really fancy meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.00,0:19:17.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You and your little ones were today's MVPs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.79,0:19:22.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you come here often, Teach?\NThey seem used to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.42,0:19:26.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, could the ghost that Miss Erna\Nsaw around here have actually been...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.00,0:19:29.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm a big animal lover.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.13,0:19:31.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's kind of surprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.92,0:19:35.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Back when we first met, I got the impression\Nyou were kind of a cold person.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.29,0:19:37.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,People have many sides to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.00,0:19:41.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't worry about how they evaluated you\Nback at your academy, Sara.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.42,0:19:44.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All they saw was a single one of your sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.46,0:19:49.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There will be plenty of days where you shine,\Njust like you did today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.29,0:19:51.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no need for you\Nto recognize any sort of place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.17,0:19:56.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.08,0:19:59.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.58,0:20:01.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This little guy is especially cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.63,0:20:03.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's Mr. Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.25,0:20:06.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He had this bad habit of biting everything\Nin sight back when he was first born,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.33,0:20:08.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but lately, he hasn't bitten anyone-
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.33,0:20:09.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Except for that one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.96,0:20:11.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He bit someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.17,0:20:13.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He gnawed on Miss Erna's hand a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.75,0:20:15.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That seems in-character for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.13,0:20:18.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I should be fine, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.13,0:20:20.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm an expert at dealing with-
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.04,0:20:23.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I'm so, so-
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.25,0:20:24.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to apologize for.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.08,0:20:26.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's just showing his affection.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.21,0:20:28.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.96,0:20:31.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You really think I would screw up like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.08,0:20:35.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, of course not,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.46,0:20:37.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but are you sure you're not just\Nputting on a strong face?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.58,0:20:39.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Perish... the thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.17,0:20:41.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're clearly fighting through the pain, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.33,0:20:42.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.54,0:20:44.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It doesn't hurt... one bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.38,0:20:46.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The odd pauses aren't helping your case!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.50,0:20:52.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I'm just an inexperienced spy who hasn't even\Nproperly trained Mr. Johnny yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.46,0:20:57.04,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,but I hope that someday,\NI'll get a chance to do big things.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.75,0:21:00.67,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,In fact, I'm sure I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.75,0:22:36.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Boss,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.96,0:22:42.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the nine of us are a new team called Lamplight,\Nand we're going to pick up where Inferno left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.33,0:22:44.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I hope you're watching over us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.25,0:22:49.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.75,0:22:52.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In light of it having successfully retrieved Abyss Doll,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.83,0:22:55.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lamplight has been formally promoted\Nto an official team.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.71,0:22:58.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How are the girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.33,0:23:02.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They got ten days off as part of their reward\Nfor completing the mission,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.54,0:23:05.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so they're probably all off on vacation right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.00,0:23:07.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.25,0:23:09.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The reason I called you here today
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.71,0:23:13.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,is because we have a lead
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.50,0:23:17.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,on that mysterious sniper who killed Guido.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.75,0:23:20.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We don't know how large it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.83,0:23:24.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and despite pursuing them for years,\Nwe don't have any solid intel on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.42,0:23:31.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But the Empire's top spy team is called Serpent,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.25,0:23:33.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and that sniper was likely one of its members.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.13,0:23:35.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Serpent...
